		<description><![CDATA[Ah, my brother and neighbor Hassan!  What a wonderful artist, with a quirky sense of humor!  He was always willing to listen and to explore both the material world and that world in which we all connect.  He was patient and forgiving, yet unafraid to move on in his life when he needed to.  I still feel his presence with the musicians in the Dance circle at Heartsong, and sense his smile.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Ah, my brother and neighbor Hassan!  What a wonderful artist, with a quirky sense of humor!  He was always willing to listen and to explore both the material world and that world in which we all connect.  He was patient and forgiving, yet unafraid to move on in his life when he needed to.  I still feel his presence with the musicians in the Dance circle at Heartsong, and sense his smile.</p>
